-- MIXED SCRIPTS IN A NAME ------------------------------------ main.kl  SEC0105

The name `nаme` mixes letters from more than one script: U+0430  comes from a different script than the letters before it. Mixing scripts is the usual way to build a name that looks like a different one.

2│     let nаme = "Sara"
            ^

Help: Write the name in one script. Digits and `_` go with any script. To show Arabic names in an English-skin project, use a display glossary (`names.toml`) instead.

Learn more: kalam explain SEC0105
